1
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:13,840
Fine.

2
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:16,640
You hit me for some rich old man.

3
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,240
Zhao Wenjuan,

4
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:20,500
you're really something.

5
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:28,320
I don't want your filthy money.

6
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:29,320
Just you wait.

7
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:05,880
Who are you?

8
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:07,400
Do we know each other?

9
00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:08,480
No.

10
00:01:09,039 --> 00:01:10,900
Then we can get to know each other.

11
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:13,930
A gentleman doesn't accept handouts.

12
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:16,360
It's not a handout.

13
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:17,690
I'm offering it.

14
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:22,050
You've been yelling for a while.
You must be thirsty.

15
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:33,560
Thanks.

16
00:01:34,240 --> 00:01:36,700
But there's no need
to get to know each other.

17
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:44,979
Let's just exchange names, okay?

18
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:47,320
I'm Gao Yayan.

19
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:48,360
What's your name?

20
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:49,520
Bai Xiaosi.

21
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:50,610
Is that okay?

22
00:01:51,479 --> 00:01:52,680
Thanks for the treat.

23
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,250
Help me look someone up.

24
00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:07,760
A kid,

25
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:09,400
about 16 or 17,

26
00:02:09,720 --> 00:02:10,720
named Bai Xiaosi.

27
00:03:59,320 --> 00:04:00,120
Shen Xi,

28
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:02,560
open the door.

29
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:04,900
I have something to tell you, Shen Xi.

30
00:04:06,920 --> 00:04:07,720
Shen Xi,

31
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,240
are you home?

32
00:04:11,440 --> 00:04:13,440
Group 2, any findings at the stairs?

33
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:15,240
Captain Weng,

34
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:16,140
nothing found.

35
00:04:17,760 --> 00:04:20,620
Group 3, what's the situation
on the surveillance?

36
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:21,800
Captain Weng,

37
00:04:21,839 --> 00:04:23,000
the surveillance shows

38
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:25,080
Shen Xi returned to the neighborhood
nine minutes ago,

39
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:26,240
entered the building,

40
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:27,700
and hasn't come out since.

41
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:29,840
Group 3, keep an eye on the surveillance,

42
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:31,520
especially the building entrance

43
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:32,480
and her car.

44
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:34,840
Shen Xi is very likely
to escape in the chaos.

45
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:36,240
Copy that, Captain Weng.

46
00:04:38,320 --> 00:04:40,080
Someone come up and get the door unlocked.

47
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:40,680
Copy that.

48
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:53,880
Jiang,

49
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:54,970
the bedroom.

50
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:08,600
Captain Weng,

51
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:10,480
Shen Xi's car is at the main gate.

52
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,680
Team 4, intercept and make the arrest.

53
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:13,280
Copy that.

54
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:31,600
This is the place.

55
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:34,050
She came up from that building,

56
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:35,440
crossed this platform,

57
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:36,600
and went down the other one,

58
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:37,860
dodging our blockade.

59
00:05:38,320 --> 00:05:38,840
Jiang!

60
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:42,120
Where's Jiang Dahai?

61
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:44,780
He dropped the ball at the worst time.

62
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:46,760
It's fine. Our guys are on her tail.

63
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:48,120
She won't get away.

64
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:49,600
Yanhu Checkpoint is in position.

65
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:51,000
Target vehicle spotted.

66
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:10,720
Get out of the car!

67
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:11,440
Get out now!

68
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:13,260
Hands off the steering wheel.

69
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:19,780
Take off your mask.

70
00:06:23,320 --> 00:06:24,120
Captain Weng,

71
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,480
we intercepted the car.

72
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:26,160
But it's the wrong person.

73
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:26,760
It's a guy.

74
00:06:27,200 --> 00:06:29,600
It's that fake cop from before,
Bai Xiaosi.

75
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:31,800
Him again. Bai Xiaosi.

76
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:35,760
Bring him back for interrogation.

77
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:36,360
Copy that.

78
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:40,520
Jiang Dahai,

79
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:42,880
where did you go?

80
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:44,280
Get back here.

81
00:07:02,640 --> 00:07:03,440
Shen Xi,

82
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:06,050
where are you going?

83
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:08,240
Decoys,

84
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:09,600
diversions,

85
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:11,120
and misdirection.

86
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:14,160
You played your tricks well, Ms. Shen.

87
00:07:15,840 --> 00:07:16,600
Tell me,

88
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:18,720
where are you planning to go?

89
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:21,450
You flatter me, Officer Li.

90
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:24,520
I just wanted to take a trip

91
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:25,600
and clear my head.

92
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:28,040
You guys keep tracking me down

93
00:07:28,440 --> 00:07:29,800
and questioning me.

94
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:32,600
Between the car accident and the suicide,

95
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:33,780
it's just too much.

96
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:36,320
I just want to get some fresh air.

97
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:38,320
Why hide from us, then?

98
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:41,040
I know

99
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:43,240
cooperating with your investigation

100
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:45,120
is every citizen's duty.

101
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,400
But to be honest,

102
00:07:47,760 --> 00:07:50,220
I really don't want
to deal with you anymore.

103
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,890
You went to all this trouble

104
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:54,400
just because you didn't want
to deal with us?

105
00:07:54,400 --> 00:07:56,400
You even dragged Bai Xiaosi into this

106
00:07:56,400 --> 00:07:57,530
to act as your decoy.

107
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:59,520
Do you have any idea how old he is?

108
00:07:59,920 --> 00:08:00,960
He's a minor

109
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:02,920
without a driver's license.

110
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:06,080
This kid

111
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:08,600
tricked me with a fake driver's license.

112
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:09,640
You mean

113
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:11,440
you didn't know he was underage

114
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:12,680
and couldn't get a license?

115
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:13,680
Of course.

116
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,040
I wouldn't

117
00:08:16,080 --> 00:08:17,440
risk my own life

118
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:18,640
when hiring a driver.

119
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:20,740
He did show me his license.

120
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:24,100
How was I supposed to know it was fake?

121
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:26,360
I'm not a traffic cop like you guys.

122
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:28,160
I don't have a pair of sharp eyes.

123
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:29,480
0451, You Xiaosi.

124
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:30,520
Remember me?

125
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:31,960
Of course,

126
00:08:31,960 --> 00:08:32,799
Officer Weng.

127
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:34,679
Last time I went to the detention center,

128
00:08:34,679 --> 00:08:36,440
you escorted me there yourself.

129
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:37,770
Good that you remember.

130
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,400
What happened this time?

131
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:41,480
How did you get mixed up with Shen Xi?

132
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,880
When you're out of luck,

133
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,680
everything goes wrong.

134
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:50,280
So you're saying

135
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:52,200
it's just bad luck that you got caught

136
00:08:52,200 --> 00:08:53,660
doing something illegal?

137
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:55,680
That's not what I meant.

138
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,760
After I got out last time,

139
00:08:58,640 --> 00:08:58,880
I wanted to find a way to make a living.

140
00:08:58,880 --> 00:09:00,280
I wanted to find a way to make a living.

141
00:09:00,280 --> 00:09:02,600
I couldn't shoot videos pretending
to be a traffic cop anymore.

142
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:03,560
That's illegal.

143
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:06,000
So I thought about

144
00:09:06,640 --> 00:09:09,000
working part-time as a driver.

145
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:10,520
A driver? What kind of driver?

146
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:11,600
Are you even 18?

147
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:13,600
I get it.

148
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:16,480
You stopped pretending to be a traffic cop

149
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:18,000
and started dealing fake IDs, right?

150
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,720
Let me tell you, that's just as illegal.

151
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:20,920
No, no, no.

152
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:22,720
I just bought a cover.

153
00:09:24,280 --> 00:09:25,920
When the employer wanted to see it,

154
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:26,800
I'd show it.

155
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:28,120
If I could fool them, great.

156
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:29,560
If not, oh well.

157
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:33,520
Tell me,

158
00:09:33,520 --> 00:09:35,880
what's your relationship
with the car owner, Shen Xi?

159
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:38,280
Why did you pretend to be her
and drive away?

160
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:40,440
I told you,

161
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:41,660
she's my employer.

162
00:09:46,880 --> 00:09:50,080
I wanted to find a driver to accompany me
on a trip out of town for a few days.

163
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:52,080
I saw his message online

164
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:54,260
and arranged to meet at a cafe.

165
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,800
You're Babbling Brook, right?

166
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:04,160
I'm Xiaosi Bubai.

167
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:15,720
Kid,

168
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:17,800
I'm looking for a girl,

169
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:20,560
not someone pretending to be one, okay?

170
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:22,560
Don't worry.

171
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:24,400
With a little dressing up

172
00:10:24,560 --> 00:10:25,360
today,

173
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:27,360
I'll look more real than a real girl.

174
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:31,760
How old are you, kid?

175
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:33,520
Are you of age?

176
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:36,120
Nineteen.

177
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:37,800
Being young is great.

178
00:10:38,280 --> 00:10:39,880
Young guys are considerate,

179
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:41,760
sweet, and obedient.

180
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:46,120
Do you have a driver's license?

181
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,400
Can you drive?

182
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,400
Of course.

183
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:55,000
I wouldn't take the job
if I didn't have the skills.

184
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,160
Let me see it.

185
00:10:58,720 --> 00:11:00,450
Let's agree on the price first.

186
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:02,720
The price is negotiable.

187
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:04,280
He interrupted me at the time,

188
00:11:04,280 --> 00:11:05,480
and I got distracted.

189
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:07,360
I figured

190
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:09,960
he was just an innocent kid

191
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:11,880
who wouldn't lie to me.

192
00:11:12,680 --> 00:11:14,340
So I didn't ask about it again.

193
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:17,000
It's that simple.

194
00:11:17,640 --> 00:11:18,600
Any problem,

195
00:11:19,160 --> 00:11:19,800
officer?

196
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:21,040
Yes, there is.

197
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:23,760
Since you hired him,

198
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:26,240
why did he drive away
instead of waiting for you

199
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:28,640
when you went upstairs
to get your luggage?

200
00:11:28,640 --> 00:11:31,200
That's because I suddenly
got a call from her.

201
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:32,720
The boss said to pick someone up

202
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:34,640
at the Chuanyun Road intersection
in five minutes,

203
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:36,200
and she'd pay me extra.

204
00:11:36,400 --> 00:11:37,040
Didn't you see the police
chasing and blocking you

205
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:38,680
when you were driving?

206
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:40,320
You were moving forward, backward,

207
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:42,160
and even trying to turn left
at that intersection.

208
00:11:42,160 --> 00:11:44,560
Why didn't you stop
when you saw the police?

209
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,440
I was scared.

210
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:49,000
I didn't know what it was about this time.

211
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:50,640
I don't have a driver's license,

212
00:11:50,640 --> 00:11:52,300
so I could only try to run away.

213
00:11:55,040 --> 00:11:57,120
I asked him to fetch something
at the intersection.

214
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:58,780
It was indeed to distract you.

215
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:01,900
Because I didn't want to deal
with you guys anymore.

216
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:03,840
I'm even sick of it.

217
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:05,360
Is that okay?

218
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:06,280
Yes.

219
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:09,200
Did you get all that down? Got it.

220
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:12,840
I hope you can give me
a reasonable explanation

221
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:14,640
for the next question too.

222
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:17,320
Go ahead.

223
00:12:18,040 --> 00:12:19,200
Xiao Ze

224
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:21,440
invited you to a dance drama.

225
00:12:22,400 --> 00:12:23,460
You didn't show up.

226
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:25,050
Where did you go?

227
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:26,640
I was performing.

228
00:12:28,640 --> 00:12:30,200
Weren't you there that day?

229
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:32,240
I was one of the masked actors

230
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:33,400
on stage.

231
00:12:33,560 --> 00:12:34,840
Then why didn't you say so

232
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:36,240
when I asked you that day?

233
00:12:38,160 --> 00:12:39,440
I'm sorry, Officer Li.

234
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:40,680
I don't know

235
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:43,360
whose memory is failing here.

236
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:45,040
As I recall,

237
00:12:45,520 --> 00:12:47,380
you never asked me that question.

238
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:49,200
You just asked me

239
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:52,760
if I went to the show
with Xiao Ze that day,

240
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:53,800
and then

241
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:54,920
asked me

242
00:12:54,920 --> 00:12:56,980
about going to the woods the next day.

243
00:12:57,280 --> 00:12:59,200
So you know the dance drama director,
Song Yanfei,

244
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:00,320
right?

245
00:13:06,800 --> 00:13:07,840
He is the person

246
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:09,680
I hate the most.

247
00:13:15,400 --> 00:13:17,330
The year I graduated from college,

248
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:19,300
I was drifting in Beijing,

249
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:22,060
hoping to find a job in a film crew.

250
00:13:22,840 --> 00:13:23,400
Okay,

251
00:13:23,560 --> 00:13:24,640
I'll wait to hear from you.

252
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:26,700
Looking forward to working with you.

253
00:13:31,920 --> 00:13:33,120
Next.

254
00:13:38,400 --> 00:13:38,960
Come in.

255
00:13:43,120 --> 00:13:43,880
Hello.

256
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:45,760
You must be the director.

257
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:47,240
How should I address you?

258
00:13:47,800 --> 00:13:49,120
Yes, I am.

259
00:13:49,120 --> 00:13:50,280
Just call me Song Yanfei,

260
00:13:50,280 --> 00:13:51,280
or Director Song.

261
00:13:53,200 --> 00:13:54,860
Got it. Hello, Director Song.

262
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:56,800
Here is my resume.

263
00:13:57,520 --> 00:13:58,840
My name is Shen Xi.

264
00:14:00,280 --> 00:14:00,880
Shen Xi.

265
00:14:00,880 --> 00:14:02,010
Please, take a seat.

266
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:07,600
I graduated from the acting department
of the Dance Academy.

267
00:14:07,600 --> 00:14:09,240
I can dance and act,

268
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:12,000
and I really look forward
to working with you.

269
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:12,600
Well,

270
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:14,770
through our conversation,

271
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:16,040
we found out

272
00:14:16,880 --> 00:14:18,610
we were from the same hometown.

273
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:21,250
That instantly brought us closer.

274
00:14:22,080 --> 00:14:23,120
At that time,

275
00:14:24,160 --> 00:14:25,360
he was preparing

276
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:27,080
for the dance drama,

277
00:14:27,480 --> 00:14:28,240
"Circle".

278
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:30,810
He explained the play to me,

279
00:14:31,240 --> 00:14:33,100
and I was completely captivated.

280
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:34,920
I loved this play so much.

281
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:36,480
I told him

282
00:14:36,800 --> 00:14:38,080
I'd dance in it

283
00:14:38,400 --> 00:14:39,720
even for free,

284
00:14:39,920 --> 00:14:41,380
as long as I had food to eat.

285
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:43,640
From that day on,

286
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:46,850
we worked hard together
to revise the script,

287
00:14:46,880 --> 00:14:49,120
meet actors, and seek investment.

288
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:51,280
During this process,

289
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:53,920
we grew closer and closer.

290
00:14:55,280 --> 00:14:56,320
Until that day,

291
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:59,040
he confessed his feelings to me.

292
00:15:00,600 --> 00:15:01,400
I like you.

293
00:15:03,520 --> 00:15:05,480
I said yes without any hesitation.

294
00:15:07,080 --> 00:15:07,960
That day,

295
00:15:09,440 --> 00:15:10,480
I gave myself

296
00:15:11,800 --> 00:15:12,760
to him.

297
00:15:24,040 --> 00:15:25,000
I thought

298
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:28,000
even if we weren't rich,

299
00:15:29,400 --> 00:15:31,080
at least I'd have a soulmate.

300
00:15:32,080 --> 00:15:33,120
But who knew,

301
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:35,480
this person would suddenly disappear

302
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:36,320
from my world.

303
00:15:36,640 --> 00:15:37,520
Disappear,

304
00:15:38,480 --> 00:15:39,400
you know?

305
00:15:40,480 --> 00:15:41,920
Vanished into thin air.

306
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:43,400
That morning,

307
00:15:44,200 --> 00:15:46,660
we were still working
together in the hotel.

308
00:15:47,040 --> 00:15:48,700
I went out to buy lunch at noon.

309
00:15:50,440 --> 00:15:51,840
When I came back...

310
00:15:54,080 --> 00:15:55,600
It's me, Yanfei.

311
00:15:57,640 --> 00:15:59,770
Open the door. I don't have my key card.

312
00:15:59,880 --> 00:16:01,610
I brought the food back for you.

313
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:05,540
What's wrong, young lady?

314
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:09,160
My boyfriend and I are preparing
for a dance drama here.

315
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:10,640
I guess he went out.

316
00:16:11,040 --> 00:16:12,840
Could you please open the door for me?

317
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:14,840
A young man was staying in this room.

318
00:16:14,960 --> 00:16:16,160
Tall and thin.

319
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:17,440
Yes, yes, yes.

320
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:18,560
You remember him, right?

321
00:16:18,560 --> 00:16:19,120
Yes.

322
00:16:19,120 --> 00:16:20,760
He checked out and left.

323
00:16:20,880 --> 00:16:21,680
Checked out?

324
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:24,330
That's impossible.

325
00:16:25,040 --> 00:16:27,160
We were still preparing here this morning.

326
00:16:27,160 --> 00:16:28,680
Please open the door for me.

327
00:16:28,680 --> 00:16:30,140
Let me go in and take a look.

328
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:53,560
Hello.

329
00:16:53,880 --> 00:16:55,140
Can I borrow the phone?

330
00:17:02,880 --> 00:17:04,760
Please page 987-03597 for me.

331
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:06,329
My last name is Shen.

332
00:17:06,560 --> 00:17:07,819
Leave a message for me.

333
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,400
Tell me why.

334
00:17:22,560 --> 00:17:24,760
Excuse me, can I borrow the phone again?

335
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:33,040
Please page 987-0357 again.

336
00:17:33,680 --> 00:17:34,810
My last name is Shen.

337
00:17:34,840 --> 00:17:36,500
Leave another message for me.

338
00:17:36,880 --> 00:17:38,340
If you don't reply to me...

339
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:40,320
I won't be able to live on.

